New thief skill: strip.

1) Strip cuts a piece of armor down one tier.
   - Heavy becomes medium, medium becomes light, light becomes clothing.
   - The classes that tier locked out can wear the result.
   - The item's own level is rescaled by the ratio between the tiers, so a
     fine piece stripped down is still fine for what it now is.

2) The work is measured by the item's structure.
   - A missed cut costs the piece a point of structure, unless your wits
     save it.
   - An item cut to nothing is destroyed.

3) Light armor stripped to clothing becomes a worn item outright.

See HELP STRIP and HELP AUGMENTATION.
